# MODULE bounded general program counter BF in BF interpreter
# PURPOSE execute all eight guest commands with general nested loop dispatch
# INPUT one unsigned length byte followed by exactly that many normalized BF commands
# INPUT then one unsigned guest fuel budget byte followed by raw guest input bytes
# OUTPUT guest output bytes followed by one diagnostic terminal status byte
# TAPE cells zero through twenty one are interpreter control and scratch
# TAPE source instructions occupy indexed cells beginning at address sixty four
# TAPE guest tape values occupy sixteen indexed cells beginning at address two hundred eight
# PROFILE each guest original instruction uses one fuel unit including evaluated brackets
# PROFILE zero bracket skips its body and nonzero closing bracket jumps after its opener
# PROFILE byte cells wrap and guest stdin EOF writes zero where host supports that behavior
# LIMITATION source length at most one hundred twenty seven and tape at most sixteen cells
# LIMITATION fuel is an unsigned one byte budget and source validation occurs before invocation
# LIMITATION guest output has a diagnostic trailing byte and is not a BFIO result stream
# LIMITATION exact input closure and original source offsets require separate trusted authority
# SAFETY intended for admitted normalized source with verified complete byte count and brackets

